# S-044: stop is idempotent and observable through stopped(); frames submitted after stop are never delivered.
vopen v I420 30 1 16 8 3
vconnect v a 1
vlock v 1 1 0x01
vunlock v
vstop v
vstop v
vstate v
# unlock after stop only posts the semaphore; nobody consumes it
vlock v 1 2 0x02
vunlock_async v
vdump v
vstate v
vclose v
